      "caption": "Exhibit 4. The audience shifts with price even though click rate barely does. Low-consumption users see 39% of the under-100 impressions and 17% of the 6,400–12,800 band; high-consumption users go from 6% to 20%. Age and shopping depth hardly move across bands, which is why consumption level became the targeting dimension in the recommendations.",
