      "caption": "Exhibit 5. Tiers follow the report's rule: click rate stands in for frequency, the price of clicked ads for monetary value. The largest group, 37%, clicks high-priced ads rarely — the win-back tier the recommendations aimed retargeting at. The two groups near a 99% click rate are mostly users seen once, which is the weakness of a nine-day log, not a loyal core.",
